{{Quote|You can't negotiate with those ''animals''. Keep the war going! Vote now!|Mot-Not Rab, decrying the Separatists during a Senate session|<ref name="Heroes on Both Sides">{{TCW|Heroes on Both Sides}}</ref>}}
'''Mot-Not Rab''' was a [[Gender|male]] [[Tarnab]] [[senator]] who represented the Tarnab [[species]]<ref name="Alien Archive">''[[Star Wars: Alien Archive]]''</ref> in the [[Galactic Senate|Senate]] of the [[Galactic Republic]] during the [[Battle of Naboo|Naboo Crisis]] and the [[Clone Wars]]. During the war he claimed to be a patriot of the Republic and was a steady supporter of [[Supreme Chancellor]] [[Darth Sidious|Sheev Palpatine]]. He held a pro-war stance and questioned or threatened any who did not.<ref name="VE">''[[Star Wars: The Visual Encyclopedia]]''</ref>

